            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was so easy and very good. I did change a couple things though. I used creamy poppy seed dressing (for the \"creamy dressing\"),honey roasted sunflower seeds,added raisens, and only used broccoli. It turned out great!"
          },
