            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "jjacak"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very good, but I did have to make a batch and a half of dressing to coat everything nicely. I added a few raisins, 1 1/2c of sharp shredded cheddar, and 6 hard boiled eggs to mine as well. I didn't have white wine vinegar, so I just used cider vinegar instead. Everybody loved it. It's even better the next day.",
